只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Per-round reasoning_effort optimizer for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): auto-downgrades tool-call reasoning for simple tool chains, lifting back for heavy work. Cuts thinking time between tool calls.","id":"gh:1333241464","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tool-turbo","slug":"Electricitysheep/dsh-tool-turbo","topics":["agent","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","harness","optimization","performance","plugin","reasoning","speed"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Per-round reasoning_effort optimizer for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): auto-downgrades tool-call reasoning"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" for simple tool chains, lifting back for heavy work. Cuts thinking time between tool calls."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-tool-turbo"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Cut tool-call latency in DeepSeek Harness (dsh) by auto-adjusting `reasoning_effort` per tool roun"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"t tool-call latency in DeepSeek Harness (dsh) by auto-adjusting `reasoning_effort` per tool round.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文文档 · English"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"In a multi-step tool chain, the model re-thinks before **every** tool call — and that thinking domin"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ates the wall-clock time (a 50-step agent task can spend minutes in reasoning between tools). `dsh-t"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ool-turbo` watches the recent tool calls of a step and injects the *lowest sensible* reasoning effor"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"t into the next model request, then lifts it again the moment the work gets heavy."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DeepSeek's API exposes `reasoning_effort` in three steps (`low` / `high` / `max`, shipped 2026-08-13"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"). dsh re-resolves the request config for **every step** through an `agent/request` waterfall (see `"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"packages/core/agent-loop/src/agent.ts` — \"plugins propose the next request config\"). `dsh-tool-turbo"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"` plugs into that waterfall:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"1. **Watch** the step's recent `tool/call` records from the session.\n2. **Decide**: simple, determin"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"istic tools (`write`, `read`, `grep`, `glob`, `bash`, `fs_*`, …) with small payloads → `low`; mixed/"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"heavy work → `high`; very heavy payloads → `max` (opt-in).\n3. **Inject** the decision into the `agen"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"t/request` config for the next model call of that step."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Long tool chains keep the cheap rounds cheap, and never starve the hard rounds of reasoning."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Verified"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Injector works in a live dsh instance** (log lines from a real run):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **6/6 unit tests** on the effort policy (`decideEffort`): fresh prompt keeps the baseline, simple-"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"tool chains downgrade to `low`, downgrades respect the user toggle, heavy payloads upgrade to `max` "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"(opt-in), mixed tools lift to `high`.\n- `tsc --noEmit` clean."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Policy (pure, testable)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Recent tool calls | Decision |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| none (fresh prompt) | keep user's selected effort |\n| ≥75% simple tools, small args, downgrade all"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"owed | `low` |\n| mixed / heavy tools | `high` (when upgrades allowed) |\n| very heavy payloads, upgra"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"de allowed | `max` |\n| otherwise | keep user's selected effort |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Toggles (settings namespace planned): `allowDowngrade` (default on), `allowUpgrade` (default off — k"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"eep `max` conservative), `baseline` (default `high`)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- [x] effort-decision core + waterfall injection\n- [x] per-tool duration telemetry (host log)\n- [ ] "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"settings namespace (dsh-settings) for the toggles\n- [ ] tool timing surfaced in the UI / agent conte"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"xt\n- [ ] profile-agnostic install docs (`headless`/`tui`)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
